{"id":17551,"name":"Cabarrus County","slug":"cabarrus-county","state":"North Carolina","code":"NC","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/north-carolina-tax-deed-sales/cabarrus-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:51:07","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Foreclosure Sale","bidProcedure":"Premium Bid","deposit":"20% of the bid amount","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"Assigned by the courts (check listings and calendar for updates)"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"61 Union Street S, Concord, NC, 28026"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Cabarrus County"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"KYHp4UNZXJxQ8o2ioEqQzPCXd0WvfDrN4RDbuv1mIselL97xO558AeqFp1ActcOLgVYVaajszTitr0J7MfCj\"><iframe title=\"Properties 40-90% Off Market Value? - Cabarrus County - North Carolina Tax Deed Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JMevCDCADk0?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Properties 40-90% Off Market Value? &#8211; Cabarrus County &#8211; North Carolina Tax Deed Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Snap up properties at dramatic discounts in Cabarrus County, North Carolina&#8217;s Tax Foreclosure Sales. Be there in person to outbid the rest, starting with the back taxes and costs.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Don&#8217;t miss out on the chance to buy properties significantly below market value in Cabarrus County, North Carolina’s Tax Foreclosure Sales! These sales, held on dates and times assigned by the courts, offer a unique opportunity for savvy investors.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Tax Foreclosure Sales Work</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Tax foreclosure sales in Cabarrus County occur when property owners fail to pay their taxes despite multiple collection attempts. These sales are public auctions where anyone can bid, starting at the amount owed in back taxes, fees, and costs. The highest bidder wins the property, but they must be prepared to make a 20% deposit immediately.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Steps to Participate</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Research and Understand Local Laws</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Familiarize yourself with the legal framework and regulations specific to Cabarrus County.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Visit the Local Treasurer&#8217;s Website</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Visit the <a href=\"https://www.cabarruscounty.us/Government/Departments/Tax-Administration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Cabarrus County Tax Administration</mark></a> page For detailed information on tax foreclosure sales.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Check the Auction Site</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Auctions are typically held at the Cabarrus County Courthouse steps, located at 77 Union Street South, Concord, NC, 28025. For upcoming sales, visit the <a href=\"https://foreclosures.cabarruscounty.us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Foreclosure Listings</mark></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Read the Details About Tax Foreclosures</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Ensure you understand the sale schedule, parcel inquiries, and other essential details. Properties are sold &#8220;as is,&#8221; so thorough research is crucial.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Contact the County Office</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>For more information, you can reach out to the Cabarrus County Tax Office at 704-920-2100.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Important Details</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Cabarrus-County-Government-Center.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Cabarrus-County-Government-Center-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Cabarrus-County-Government-Center-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Cabarrus-County-Government-Center-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Cabarrus-County-Government-Center-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Cabarrus-County-Government-Center-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Cabarrus-County-Government-Center.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Cabarrus-County-Government-Center.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Cabarrus-County-Government-Center-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Cabarrus-County-Government-Center-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Cabarrus-County-Government-Center-