the auction.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>How do I find out about upcoming sales?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Check the <a href=\"https://foreclosures.cabarruscounty.us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Foreclosure Listings</mark></a> for updates.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What payment methods are accepted?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can use cash, money orders, or certified funds for deposits and payments.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Visit the <a href=\"https://www.cabarruscounty.us/Government/Departments/Tax-Administration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Cabarrus County Tax Administration</mark></a> or <a href=\"https://foreclosures.cabarruscounty.us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Foreclosure Listing</mark></a> for more detailed information.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Useful Links</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cabarruscounty.us/Government/Departments/Tax-Administration/Tax-Collections/Foreclosures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Cabarrus County Tax Foreclosure Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cabarruscounty.us/Government/Departments/Tax-Administration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Cabarrus County Tax Administration</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cabarruscounty.us/Home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color 